    "Affected consumer/cause-specific controls, architecture/semantics, canonical reconciliation and exact installed SDK/private-runtime parity."
  ],
  "compatibility": "Valid documents and CLI/status identities unchanged. Ambiguous YAML becomes a typed failure; supported merges and original byte-encoding behavior remain valid. No whole-goal or lifecycle closure from this batch.",
